VALUES ('19902067-3b80-52de-986b-10c328f51542', 'b88f6d82-0257-5c26-a55c-38ec8e06fcf6', '6acf172c-b7ef-564f-b55c-61ce0db23abe', 'fbd956d9-615b-5d01-a889-c05dd3ece722', 'To Currency', 'Currency into which an amount is converted. Identifies the target denomination of the converted monetary amount. Conversion direction is from fromCurrency to toCurrency; reversing the direction requires an appropriate inverse rate rather than assuming arithmetic equivalence. Identifies the currency of the resulting Money value. Required for an auditable conversion. Required — the record cannot be saved while this is empty.', 30, 30, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
